WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.967
Q-Geo: vector maps and tools for the field.

2
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:13.133
Prepare an offline map: choose its name, area and detail.

3
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:18.533
Download through Tor. The app checks and saves the files.

4
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:22.500
The Rome map is verified: 4.8 MB on the device.

5
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.233
Explore the map even in airplane mode.

6
00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:35.500
Choose a style: Tactical, Day or OLED.

7
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.967
Create a personal collection and add a point on the map.

8
00:00:41.967 --> 00:00:49.700
Set the report category, radius and validity.

9
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:53.533
Check the location and choose whether to round it.

10
00:00:53.533 --> 00:01:03.933
Add a note and save the point to your collection.

11
00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:08.900
Open the point to review its details and status.

12
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:14.333
Search your reports and locate the point on the map.

13
00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:17.967
Your map, available even without a connection.
